  "configuration_notes": [
    "The application source is unmodified. Local ignored configuration supplies database/Redis settings and disables mail, AI, Kafka and ZeroMQ publishing.",
    "The official core image provides PHP/Composer dependencies. The application and pinned CakePHP source are mounted from the checkout; the pinned galaxy files are initialized for REST-client API metadata.",
    "Capture and API tests use loopback/Docker-local HTTP only. The documentation examples require HTTPS with certificate verification. Container outbound traffic retains the session proxy and trusted CA bundle; only local service names and loopback addresses bypass the proxy.",
    "The PHP capture server uses four workers so its actual REST client can perform a loopback API request. That request supplies a temporary regular-user read-only key explicitly. A POST search succeeds and an attribute write returns 403. The temporary key was deleted after the checks.",
    "All new API/PyMISP exercise events use distribution 0, remain unpublished and have every IDS flag disabled. Values use reserved documentation domains and addresses. A private value note, collection reference and synthetic sighting were checked.",
    "The CSV parser and URL-components hover module run in a separate local misp-modules 3.1.3 container. CSV parsing returns two reserved attributes with IDS off. The actual MISP import preview is captured before saving; the event attribute count is unchanged.",
    "No external provider, LLM, target connector, event publication or synchronization was exercised. AI remains disabled. Kafka, ZeroMQ publication and remote encrypted transport are source-checked, not end-to-end delivery tests.",
    "ZeroMQ tests execute the documented decoder with malformed frames, absent action and a real single-frame in-process PAIR socket transfer. This checks framing, not live MISP PUB/SUB delivery or durable recovery.",
    "The exact connector snapshot example was executed with the temporary read-only key. Its published/IDS-enabled selection correctly stages zero private training attributes; no target upload is implemented or performed.",
    "The PyMISP executable cell was genuinely re-executed with the pinned client against the private local fixture. All three HTML/EPUB/Typst frozen results are regenerated; ordinary builds reuse those committed results without live credentials."
  ],
